data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":77,"item_id":"rs_0965efa845634581016acab2f02a28819492743dc0e030aa51","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test file structure**\n\nI need to figure out if I should append tests via the last edit or create a new file to streamline my own imports. It seems acceptable to migrate my own tests while keeping things standalone. I’m thinking it might be best to use an existing test and insert new tests before the first one to reuse the helpers. This way, I can avoid any unnecessary duplication!"}

